<title>USA: J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $2.04		    $1.80</p>
<p> Net			 419,000		  366,000</p>
<p> Total revs	    1,805,000		1,518,000</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $7.63		    $6.42</p>
<p> Net		     1,574,000		1,296,000</p>
<p> Total revs	    6,855,000		5,904,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Trading revs rose 39 pct to $512 million in Q4 and rose 80 pct to $2.477 bln in 1996.</p>
<p>Investment banking revs rose 75 pct to $277 million in Q4 and rose 58 pct to $921 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Investment management fees rose 17 pct to $182 million in Q4 and rose 18 pct to $675 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Net interest revs were flat in Q4 at $484 million and fell 15 pct to $1.702 bln in 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets at current period end were $222 bln.</p>
</text>
